LAMMPS (19 Nov 2024 - Development - patch_19Nov2024-56-ga78aee5731)
# Al2O3 Minimization using COMB3 Potential

units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p

read_data       ../../structure/SiO2/SiO2.data
